{"ref":"BDB, יִשְׁוִי²","hw":"יִשְׁוִי²","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">יִשְׁוִי</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  in Asher, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 46:17\" href=\"/Genesis.46.17\">Gn 46:17</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:30\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.30\">1 Ch 7:30</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:44\" href=\"/Numbers.26.44\">Nu 26:44</a>; Ιεουλ, Ιουλ, Ισουι, Ιεσου, etc.<br><strong>2.</strong>  a son of Saul <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:49\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.49\">1 S 14:49</a>; Ιεσσιου(λ), but read <span dir=\"rtl\">אישׁבעל</span> as <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:33\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.33\">1 Ch 8:33</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:39\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.39\">9:39</a> (v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אִישׁ־בֹ֫שֶׁת\" href=\"/BDB,_אִישׁ־בֹ֫שֶׁת\", dir=\"rtl\">אִישׁ־בֹּשֶׁת</a> p. 36a), cf. We Dr al.","next":"BDB, יִשְׁוִי³","prev":"BDB, יִשְׁוָה²"}